Hi Andy,

the thermal subsystem displays internal kernel pointers in =
/proc/acpi/thermal_zone/.../trip-points instead of the device names. The =
attached patch solves this. Since ACPI is rapidly getting a larger user =
base without internal kernel knowledge, please apply.

Regards, Herbert.

PS.: patch also uploaded to
